OL,3,GNEWSAControversial village housing plan
OL,4,Aput on hold
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial plans to build hundreds
OL,7,Fof homes in a seaside village have been
OL,8,Fput on hold, a council has said.
OL,10,FEarlier this year, proposals for 446
OL,11,Fhomes and a 70-bed care home at
OL,12,FHopton-on-Sea in Norfolk were approved
OL,13,Fin the face of opposition from dozens
OL,14,Fof people, a parish council and MP.
OL,16,FDespite concerns about the impact on
OL,17,Flocal services and traffic, Repton
OL,18,FProperty Developments ` which is owned
OL,19,Fby Norfolk County Council ` said the
OL,20,Fhomes were "much needed".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
