OL,3,GNEWSAControversial village housing plan
OL,4,Aput on hold
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the council's Reform UK leader,
OL,7,FDavid Bick, said the authority was
OL,8,Flooking at the viability of the firm's
OL,9,Fprojects and the plans were now being
OL,10,Fpaused.
